      "description": "<h2>Added</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Add sort by popularity/downloads to search for mods</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Fix</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Issue with resolving paths</li>\n<li>Mod list is not cached</li>\n<li>Start Server and Instance error</li>\n<li>Error while accessing local Server/Client Paths</li>\n<li>Missing error message while adding a new instance and selecting a wrong directory</li>\n<li>Misleading tutorial instance path</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Improve</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Styling and Ui of the server console output</li>\n<li>Improve performance loading mod information</li>\n<li>Instance overview mod list</li>\n</ul>\n",
